{"4426080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Into the Liminal", "steam_appid": 4426080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/c06e89a1cce9a1a3b9f696e54db5c033.avif?t=1774616074\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras_big/c06e89a1cce9a1a3b9f696e54db5c033.webp?t=1774616074 width=1560 height=743 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into the Liminal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An eerie-calm walking experience set in intact liminal spaces that feel recently emptied. Follow subtle changes, cross thresholds, and search for her in a place that refuses evidence. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/62f2f26c6ed91d08f9835fc52445f686.poster.avif?t=1774616074\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/62f2f26c6ed91d08f9835fc52445f686.webm?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/62f2f26c6ed91d08f9835fc52445f686.mp4?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>  </strong><br> <br> <strong>The Liminal Calm by 19:48</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal project created by someone who can't stop thinking about liminal spaces. At times, these spaces offer a rare calm — a sense of detachment, like sinking <i>underwater or drifting through open space</i>, where sound fades and nothing demands your attention.<br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/6d6178b5dd89526ebe0479e9828a6805.poster.avif?t=1774616074\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/6d6178b5dd89526ebe0479e9828a6805.webm?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/6d6178b5dd89526ebe0479e9828a6805.mp4?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist  is searching. <br> <br>Nothing. <br> <br>Only the sense  <br><i>she</i> <i>was just</i> <i>here</i>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/7e274a11750186f734a8c5ad424a93ef.webp?t=1774616074\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/7f40a9b41d7e91a8fc76d1b7a3b0180b.poster.avif?t=1774616074\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/7f40a9b41d7e91a8fc76d1b7a3b0180b.webm?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/7f40a9b41d7e91a8fc76d1b7a3b0180b.mp4?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Quiet Tension</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not about rushing or fighting — it is about wandering. About the strange calm of spaces frozen in time, and the quiet tension that appears when you realize something here might not be exactly as it seems.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/c240052580ac267718cdbba5764ea8c7.poster.avif?t=1774616074\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/c240052580ac267718cdbba5764ea8c7.webm?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/c240052580ac267718cdbba5764ea8c7.mp4?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice subtle environmental changes and hidden transitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all patterns here are random. Piece together what was left behind to reveal hidden thresholds and step further into the unknown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for and collect <i>hidden objects</i> quietly left behind in these spaces</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore intact liminal spaces guided by hypnotic ambient music</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nonlinear experience that asks nothing of you — wander, observe, and decide how far you want to go</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/8ab40ab4945915f7941d159198debb3f.poster.avif?t=1774616074\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/8ab40ab4945915f7941d159198debb3f.webm?t=1774616074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4426080/extras/8ab40ab4945915f7941d159198debb3f.mp4?t=1